---
title: How to change Quotation prefix and use precision number as quotation number
sidebar:
  order: 9
---
**To customize the quotation number prefix and enable precision numbering for your quotations, follow these steps:**

1. **Access the Settings Menu**

   - **Click on your profile avatar or name at the top right of the dashboard.**
   - **Select Settings from the dropdown.**

1. **Navigate to Quotation Settings**

   - **On the left sidebar, click on Quotations Settings.**

1. **Select the General Tab**

   - **Once in the Quotation Settings, go to the General tab.**

1. **Change the Quotation Number Prefix**

   - **Locate the Quotation Number Prefix input field.**
   - **Enter the desired prefix (e.g., “Quo-“) for your quotations. This prefix will be prepended to all generated quotation numbers.**

1. **Enable Quotation Number Precision**

   - **Toggle the Quotation Number Precision switch to enable precision numbering. When enabled, this option ensures that your quotation numbers follow a precise and consistent format.**

1. **Save Changes**

   - **After setting your desired prefix and enabling the precision option, click the Save Changes button to apply the new settings.**

**These settings allow you to standardize your quotation numbers with a specific prefix and a precise numbering format, making your quotations more organized and easier to track.**
